  "body": "This beautiful home on a freehold site may be the one you have been waiting for.\r\n\r\nDesigned to capture its sunny north-facing aspect, the light-filled open-plan living flows seamlessly to a private alfresco entertaining area-perfect for relaxing or hosting family and friends.\r\n\r\nWake up to stunning Hauraki Gulf views wrap yourself in a towel, slip into your jandals and head down to Winstone's Cove for a morning swim, just minutes from local shops, cafes, and coastal walkways. Positioned in sought-after Olde Torbay, this stylish freehold brick and weatherboard home offers the coastal lifestyle you've been searching for.\r\n\r\nOffering four bedrooms across a flexible layout, the home provides space for every stage of family life. A lower-level bedroom with ensuite is ideal for guests, teenagers, or working from home, while the upper-level master retreat enjoys beautiful sea views, its own ensuite, and a private landing.\r\n\r\nComplete with double internal-access garaging, additional parking for a boat or jet ski, a gas fireplace, security alarm, and excellent storage, every detail has been thoughtfully considered.\r\n\r\nThis is your opportunity to secure an exceptional Olde Torbay lifestyle. Enquire today.  All agents welcome.\r\n\r\nTo download the property files please visit:- https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/5J3R",
